05:12.080 --> 05:14.860
reachable futures once you actively interact with them.

05:14.860 --> 05:19.300
So wait, looking at a system and interacting with it are mathematically distinct?

05:19.520 --> 05:25.080
Completely distinct. The paper uses this fantastic example of a load-bearing beam.

