You'd think so, but the author proves that this isn't about lacking sensory data.

06:19.740 --> 06:23.740
It's actually a structural type mismatch in the math itself.

06:23.920 --> 06:24.980
A type mismatch.

06:25.260 --> 06:29.600
Yeah. And to explain this, the paper brings in Judea Pearl's Ducalculus.

